S1) 的音色参考。\n\nsummary:\n母亲温柔地将装满蛋糕的竹篮递给小红帽，郑重叮嘱她不要离开小路。\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (出现在 [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - 母亲温柔慈祥的形象。\n<Subject 2> (出现在 [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - 小红帽的红斗篷。\n<Subject 3> (出现在 [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - 小木屋大门、木台阶。\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] 第三人称中景固定镜头：母亲站在小木屋门边微倾身子，面带慈爱与关切的郑重神情，双手稳稳将竹篮递向正前方的小红帽；小红帽站在台阶前，双手微抬准备接纳。母亲 (S1) 用关切郑重的声音说：<d>[Chinese] 路上千万不要离开小路，直接去外婆家，知道吗？</d>\n\noverall_soundscape: 清晨鸟鸣与风声延续，竹篮提手微晃声与棉布摩擦声。\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A，禁止背景音乐。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 59, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "$prompt.value!", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.73", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [20], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "size": [315.9910888671875, 79.80136108398438], "pos": [-698.720458984375, 823.3804931640625], "widgets_values": [6], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "Float (duration)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "int", "links": [83], "label": "int", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "int"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [-222.73094177246094, 792.7069091796875], "widgets_values": [1056], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 57, "type": "easy int", "title": "$width.value", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "8ecc929cd41cf0f7ef6fcc45d4bbc5729c6